<title>USA: USDA ups operational GSM-102 credits to Pakistan.</title>
<headline>USDA ups operational GSM-102 credits to Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Thursday said it released another $20 million in export credit guarantees to Pakistan under GSM-102 for fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>The total allocation to Pakistan under the program stands at $250 million. USDA said of the total, $70 million has now been allocated and $180 million remains unallocated.</p>
</text>
